//////////////////
////////////////// Controller parameters
//////////////////
1 // Index of the body that is controlled with the winches
0.3679 1 -0.6315 1 // Controller state-space model parameters [A B C D]
3900 5200 120000 // Lead controller gains (Kc)
0.003 0.003 0.002 // Integral time gains (Ki)
0.9842 0.125 0.1263 // Filter state-space model parameters [A B C]
0.9950 0.0625 0.0798 0.0 // Reference state-space model parameters [A B C D]
4 3 0.08727 // Vector of reference positions x(m), y(m), heading(rad) 0 0 0 4 3 0.08727
10000.0 // Winches gain (Kw)
20.0 // Time to start controlling the body
